        " «لاَ بَأْسَ أَنْ يُصَلِّيَ ثُمَّ يَسْعَى »."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2828 - Rifa'a asked him about a man who is performing Tawaf around the House (Ka'bah) when the time for the Asr prayer begins. Should he perform Sa'y before praying, or should he pray before performing Sa'y?\nImam (as) replied: \"There is no harm in praying first and then performing Sa'y.\""
        ]
      }
